<title>SPAIN: Repsol tentative sale calendar - sources.</title>
<headline>Repsol tentative sale calendar - sources.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>A tentative calendar for the sale of the Spanish state's last 10.0 percent stake in Repsol is as follows, market sources told Reuters on Wednesday.</p>
<p>No official information was available from any of the entities involved in the privatisation.</p>
<p>Market sources said the Spanish syndicate for the privatisation is likely to be comprised of La Caixa, Banco Bilbao Vizcaya (BBV), Banco Central Hispano and Banco Santander.</p>
<p>In December, state holding firm SEPI named BBV Interactivos, Goldman Sachs and Santander Investment as global coordinators. APRIL 4</p>
<p>Publication of share offer prospectus</p>
<p>APRIL 7-10</p>
<p>Pre-marketing period</p>
<p>APRIL 10-11</p>
<p>Spanish roadshow</p>
<p>APRIL 7-21</p>
<p>Period of provisional share purchase requests</p>
<p>APRIL 14</p>
<p>Institutional book-building period starts</p>
<p>APRIL 14-18</p>
<p>European roadshow</p>
<p>APRIL 21</p>
<p>Maximum retail share price to be fixed</p>
<p>APRIL 22-25</p>
<p>Period for institutional sale, irrevocable share purchase</p>
<p>requests</p>
<p>APRIL 28</p>
<p>Institutional, retail share price to be fixed</p>
<p>APRIL 29</p>
<p>Allocation to be decided</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
